---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
	<div class="footer-inner">
		<div class="footer-brand">
			<span class="logo-abbr">DAMS</span>
			<span class="logo-desc">荷兰华人数据社群</span>
		</div>
		<p class="footer-desc">连接荷兰数据行业华人从业者与学习者的专业社区</p>
		<p class="footer-copy">&copy; {year} 荷兰华人数据社群 DAMS. 保留所有权利。</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		background: #1e293b;
		color: #94a3b8;
		padding: 2.5em 1em;
		margin-top: 4em;
	}
	.footer-inner {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.footer-brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.5em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
	.logo-abbr {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #60a5fa;
	}
	.logo-desc {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #94a3b8;
	}
	.footer-desc {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin: 0 0 1em 0;
		color: #64748b;
	}
	.footer-copy {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		margin: 0;
		color: #475569;
	}
</style>
